  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 — Adds Scrubkit.Epub (.epub e-books) and Scrubkit.Extensions.DependencyInjection (services.AddScrubkit(...) for ASP.NET Core / worker hosts), plus a BenchmarkDotNet throughput harness (~12,000 files/sec, 4-way). Core: .epub files now bucket as Document. Full changelog: https://github.com/jjopensoftworks-blip/Scrubkit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
